== diag.unique-borrowed-mutation
BYN2783 10:23 `xs` borrows from what it was bound to and cannot be changed or moved |`append` modifies it|change the subject itself, or work on a `.copy(to: alloc)`; a loop or pattern variable of a unique type borrows from its subject|
BYN2783 12:27 `xs` borrows from what it was bound to and cannot be changed or moved |moving it would take the value out of what it borrows from|move or copy the value it was bound to instead|
BYN2783 15:35 `items` borrows from what it was bound to and cannot be changed or moved |`append` modifies it|change the subject itself, or work on a `.copy(to: alloc)`; a loop or pattern variable of a unique type borrows from its subject|
